# Payverge edge, EDGE=none (default): Caddy is the internet-facing server.
#
# Certificates are automatic:
#   - a public domain gets a Let's Encrypt (or ZeroSSL) certificate over ACME;
#     ports 80 and 443 must reach this host and DNS must point at it.
#   - DOMAIN=localhost (or *.localhost, *.local, *.internal, an IP address)
#     gets a certificate from Caddy's internal CA. Browsers warn until you
#     trust it; see deploy/README.md.
#
# Behind Cloudflare (orange cloud), use Caddyfile.cloudflare instead by
# setting EDGE=cloudflare in .env.
#
# Client IP: by default {client_ip} is the TCP peer and any X-Forwarded-For a
# client sends is replaced (payverge.caddy). Only when another proxy or load
# balancer sits in front of this Caddy, list its addresses in
# TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS (.env) so Caddy reads the client IP it forwards. Such a
# proxy usually APPENDS the address it saw to the X-Forwarded-For the client
# sent, so Caddy then reads the list right to left and takes the first address
# that is not a trusted proxy (trusted_proxies_strict); a value the client
# put in front is never used.
#
# Environment (set by docker-compose.yml from .env):
#   DOMAIN                               the public host name, no scheme or path
#   CADDY_ACME_EMAIL_OPTION              "email <ACME_EMAIL>" or empty (no ACME contact)
#   CADDY_TRUSTED_PROXIES_OPTION         "trusted_proxies static <TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS>"
#                                        or empty (trust no upstream proxy)
#   CADDY_TRUSTED_PROXIES_STRICT_OPTION  "trusted_proxies_strict" whenever
#                                        TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS is set, else empty
#   CADDY_HSTS                           the Strict-Transport-Security value
#                                        (HSTS_POLICY; payverge.caddy)
#   CADDY_SITE_SCHEME                    "http://" with TLS_TERMINATION=proxy
#                                        (another server terminates TLS), else
#                                        unset (payverge.caddy)
{
	{$CADDY_ACME_EMAIL_OPTION}

	servers {
		timeouts {
			read_header 15s
			idle 2m
		}
		{$CADDY_TRUSTED_PROXIES_OPTION}
		{$CADDY_TRUSTED_PROXIES_STRICT_OPTION}
	}
}

import payverge.caddy
